 1136                   ; Calculates physical drive from DBANK and IOT -> C
 1137                   ; only for Mini disks
 1138                   
 1139                   ; DBANK, IOT     C
 1140                   ;  0     F    -> 0
 1141                   ;  1     F    -> 2
