 1150                   ; calculates physical sector from logical sector, IOS -> E
 1151                   ; logical sector 0..39 -> physical sector 1..5
 1152                   
 1153                   ; calculates logical track from physical track, IOT -> D
 1154                   ; 0..159 -> 0..79 (max 127)
